                "description": "Transmission security. S3 bucket policies deny aws:SecureTransport=false on uploads, evidence, and CloudTrail buckets (GAP-03). Intake Lambda runs inside the starter VPC private subnets with S3/DynamoDB gateway endpoints (GAP-05).",
